{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43102","headline":"巫峡听猿 · 吴商浩","name":"巫峡听猿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巴江猨啸苦，响入客舟中。\n孤枕破残梦，三声随晓风。\n连云波澹澹，和雾雨蒙蒙。\n巫峡去家远，不堪魂断空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴商浩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43102.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43102","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}